-- new widgets (psychometric function, Corbetta PET, Hillyard ERP). All nine
-- widgets are database blocks at the manuscript's positions, so they can be
-- moved on the chapter page. Working memory is still to come.
--
-- Status stays draft (creators only). Idempotent: the archive step runs only
-- on the 3 Sep draft (the section it renamed), the seed only when the slug
-- is free, and the follow-ups only touch this chapter's new rows.

BEGIN;

